{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-ii", "title": "告子下", "description": "任人有問屋廬子曰：「禮與食孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n「色與禮孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n曰：「以禮食，則飢而死；不以禮食，則得食，必以禮乎？親迎，則不得妻；不親迎，則得妻，必親迎乎！」\n屋廬子不能對，明日之鄒以告孟子。孟子曰：「於答是也何有？不揣其本而齊其末，方寸之木可使高於岑樓。金重於羽者，豈謂一鉤金與一輿羽之謂哉？取食之", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "先生", "id": "先生"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "弟", "id": "弟"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "懷", "id": "懷"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "紾", "id": "紾"}, {"form": "義", "variants": [], "id": "義"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "說", "id": "說"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.4849066497880004, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "義", "target": "去"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "義", "target": "先生"}, {"weight": 1.6582280766035324, "source": "義", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.6582280766035324, "source": "義", "target": "說"}, {"weight": 2.128231705849268, "source": "義", "target": "悅"}, {"weight": 1.840549633397487, "source": "義", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.0076405104623831, "source": "義", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.3364722366212129, "source": "義", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.3513752571634776, "source": "義", "target": "懷"}, {"weight": 1.6582280766035324, "source": "義", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 1.6582280766035324, "source": "義", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "義", "target": "兄"}, {"weight": 2.3513752571634776, "source": "義", "target": "弟"}, {"weight": 2.533696813957432, "source": "懷", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.7007876910223283, "source": "懷", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.0296194171811581, "source": "懷", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.3513752571634776, "source": "懷", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 2.35137525716347